{"id":"4041cfa2975b8dd1","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-sat.md","title":"Boolean Satisfiability","display":"df-sat — Boolean Satisfiability","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-boolean-formula]]","[[28-df-cnf]]","[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]"],"display":"df-sat — Boolean Satisfiability","label":"28-df-sat","aliases":["28-df-sat"],"type":"definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b830febc662345bf\" href=\"?note=b830febc662345bf\" title=\"28-df-boolean-formula\">28-df-boolean-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c8f19b1793fdfb6a\" href=\"?note=c8f19b1793fdfb6a\" title=\"28-df-cnf\">28-df-cnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2eb3efc252f058f9\" href=\"?note=2eb3efc252f058f9\" title=\"28-df-boolean-evaluation\">28-df-boolean-evaluation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sat — Boolean Satisfiability"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-sat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-sat</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFml},\\mathrm{PropVar},x_i\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFml},\\mathrm{PropVar},x_i\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b830febc662345bf\" href=\"?note=b830febc662345bf\" title=\"28-df-boolean-formula\">28-df-boolean-formula</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Clause},\\mathrm{CNF}\">\\(\\mathrm{Clause},\\mathrm{CNF}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c8f19b1793fdfb6a\" href=\"?note=c8f19b1793fdfb6a\" title=\"28-df-cnf\">28-df-cnf</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eval}_\\alpha,\\mathrm{CNFEval}_\\alpha\">\\(\\mathrm{Eval}_\\alpha,\\mathrm{CNFEval}_\\alpha\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2eb3efc252f058f9\" href=\"?note=2eb3efc252f058f9\" title=\"28-df-boolean-evaluation\">28-df-boolean-evaluation</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(i)\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}(i)\\)</span> 为自然数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 的无前导零二进制表示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0\\)</span>；相邻字串表示连接，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span> 是空串，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[q]=\\{1,\\ldots,q\\}\">\\([q]=\\{1,\\ldots,q\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm B}\">\\(\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm B}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\">\\(\\prec\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{Cl}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{Cl}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CNF}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CNF}}\\)</span> 由下式构造。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(i\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{BoolFml}\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{BoolFml}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathrm{Clause}\">\\(C\\in\\mathrm{Clause}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\in\\mathrm{CNF}\">\\(\\Phi\\in\\mathrm{CNF}\\)</span>。在子句和 CNF 编码式中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=\\{\\ell_1,\\ldots,\\ell_q\\}\">\\(C=\\{\\ell_1,\\ldots,\\ell_q\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q=|C|\">\\(q=|C|\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall i,j\\in[q]\\;(i&lt;j\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\ell_i)\\prec\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\ell_j))\">\\(\\forall i,j\\in[q]\\;(i&lt;j\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\ell_i)\\prec\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\ell_j))\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi=\\{C_1,\\ldots,C_t\\}\">\\(\\Phi=\\{C_1,\\ldots,C_t\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=|\\Phi|\">\\(t=|\\Phi|\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall i,j\\in[t]\\;(i&lt;j\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{Cl}}(C_i)\\prec\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{Cl}}(C_j))\">\\(\\forall i,j\\in[t]\\;(i&lt;j\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{Cl}}(C_i)\\prec\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{Cl}}(C_j))\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q=0\">\\(q=0\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=0\">\\(t=0\\)</span> 时，相应字串连接为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>这些编码使用完整的下列前缀字串，不附加填充；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SAT},\\mathrm{CNFSAT},\\mathrm{Satisfiable}_{\\mathrm B}\">\\(\\mathrm{SAT},\\mathrm{CNFSAT},\\mathrm{Satisfiable}_{\\mathrm B}\\)</span> 是下式定义的集合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm B}(i)\\coloneqq1^{|\\operatorname{bin}(i)|}0\\operatorname{bin}(i)\\qquad(i\\in\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm B}(i)\\coloneqq1^{|\\operatorname{bin}(i)|}0\\operatorname{bin}(i)\\qquad(i\\in\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u\\prec v\\Longleftrightarrow |u|&lt;|v|\\lor\\left(|u|=|v|\\land\\exists j\\in[|u|]\\;\\left[u_j=0\\land v_j=1\\land\\forall k\\in[j-1]\\;u_k=v_k\\right]\\right)\\qquad(u,v\\in\\Sigma^*).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u\\prec v\\Longleftrightarrow |u|&lt;|v|\\lor\\left(|u|=|v|\\land\\exists j\\in[|u|]\\;\\left[u_j=0\\land v_j=1\\land\\forall k\\in[j-1]\\;u_k=v_k\\right]\\right)\\qquad(u,v\\in\\Sigma^*).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(x_i)&amp;\\coloneqq00\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm B}(i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\neg\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq01\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq10\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\varphi)\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\psi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq11\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\varphi)\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\psi).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(x_i)&amp;\\coloneqq00\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm B}(i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\neg\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq01\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq10\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\varphi)\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\psi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq11\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\varphi)\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\psi).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{Cl}}(C)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm B}(q)\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\ell_1)\\cdots\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\ell_q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{Cl}}(C)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm B}(q)\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\ell_1)\\cdots\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\ell_q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CNF}}(\\Phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm B}(t)\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{Cl}}(C_1)\\cdots\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{Cl}}(C_t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CNF}}(\\Phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm B}(t)\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{Cl}}(C_1)\\cdots\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{Cl}}(C_t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}:\\mathrm{BoolFml}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*,\\qquad\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{Cl}}:\\mathrm{Clause}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*,\\qquad\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CNF}}:\\mathrm{CNF}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}:\\mathrm{BoolFml}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*,\\qquad\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{Cl}}:\\mathrm{Clause}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*,\\qquad\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CNF}}:\\mathrm{CNF}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Satisfiable}_{\\mathrm B}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{BoolFml}\\mid\\exists\\alpha:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\mathrm{Eval}_\\alpha(\\varphi)=1\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{SAT}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Satisfiable}_{\\mathrm B}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{CNFSAT}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CNF}}(\\Phi)\\mid\\Phi\\in\\mathrm{CNF}\\land\\exists\\alpha:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\mathrm{CNFEval}_\\alpha(\\Phi)=1\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Satisfiable}_{\\mathrm B}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{BoolFml}\\mid\\exists\\alpha:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\mathrm{Eval}_\\alpha(\\varphi)=1\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{SAT}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Satisfiable}_{\\mathrm B}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{CNFSAT}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CNF}}(\\Phi)\\mid\\Phi\\in\\mathrm{CNF}\\land\\exists\\alpha:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\mathrm{CNFEval}_\\alpha(\\Phi)=1\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书本章 SAT 指 CNF 可满足性，本目录历史上的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SAT}\">\\(\\mathrm{SAT}\\)</span> 指一般布尔公式可满足性，故显式保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CNFSAT}\">\\(\\mathrm{CNFSAT}\\)</span> 区分。由局部门约束引入新变量，可把一般公式等可满足地化为 CNF；反向把子句表写成布尔公式。因此两个语言多项式时间互约，完全性结论一致，但表示不混用。</p>\n<p>来源核对：§2.3.1、定理2.10与引理6.11；印刷44–45、111页；PDF70–71、137页。已核对原书CNF版本并明确本目录变体。</p>\n<p>本次内容修订：上述前缀码可唯一递归解析。公式码长等于语法树节点数的两倍，加各变量出现位置的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2|\\operatorname{bin}(i)|+1\">\\(2|\\operatorname{bin}(i)|+1\\)</span>；公式编码没有填充或对变量索引作一元展开。子句表按显式短字典序排列，保留有限集合去重表示。这里只检验所给文本的接口，没有重新核对未提供的 PDF。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-boolean-formula","status":"resolved","id":"b830febc662345bf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-cnf",