i)&\\coloneqq11\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\varphi)\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\psi).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{Cl}}(C)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm B}(q)\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\ell_1)\\cdots\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\ell_q).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CNF}}(\\Phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm B}(t)\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{Cl}}(C_1)\\cdots\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{Cl}}(C_t).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}:\\mathrm{BoolFml}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*,\\qquad\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{Cl}}:\\mathrm{Clause}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*,\\qquad\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CNF}}:\\mathrm{CNF}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Satisfiable}_{\\mathrm B}&\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{BoolFml}\\mid\\exists\\alpha:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\mathrm{Eval}_\\alpha(\\varphi)=1\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{SAT}&\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Satisfiable}_{\\mathrm B}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{CNFSAT}&\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CNF}}(\\Phi)\\mid\\Phi\\in\\mathrm{CNF}\\land\\exists\\alpha:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\mathrm{CNFEval}_\\alpha(\\Phi)=1\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SAT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CNFSAT}","display":false},{"tex":"2|\\operatorname{bin}(i)|+1","display":false}],"bytes":4332,"backlinks":[{"id":"5408daacba221251","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CNF}}:\\mathrm{CNF}\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*$ 使用 [[28-df-sat]] 中已逐字段定义的规范编码。"},{"id":"d6ed84d59965705b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$a:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 为赋值；$\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm B}$、$\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{Cl}}$ 见 [[28-df-sat]]；$\\operatorname{enc}_3$ 在下式按有序子句表构造，邻接字串表示连接。"},{"id":"6f4ddd360c890dee","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoolFml},\\mathrm{PropVar},\\mathrm{Eval}_\\alpha$ 来自 [[28-df-boolean-formula]]、[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]。$\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}$ 为 [[28-df-sat]] 固定的有效公式编码。\n$\\mathbf{FP}$ 为多项式时间字串函数类，see [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]。$P:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}^*$；证明是二进制字串；$c,d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$。"},{"id":"f1e311cc01fd17ee","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$。$\\mathrm{CNF},\\mathrm{PropVar},\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B},\\mathrm{CNFEval}$ 及有效单射编码 $\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CNF}}$ 分别见 [[28-df-sat]]、[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]。每个 CNF 是有限子句集，各文字是布尔公式。\n$\\widehat a$ 是下式对有限赋值 $a$ 的零延拓；$\\#\\mathrm{SAT}:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbb N$ 对非法编码也有值。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-49","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"布尔问题：[[28-df-boolean-formula]]、[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]、[[28-df-cnf]]、[[28-df-literal]]、[[28-df-clause]]、[[28-df-sat]]、[[28-df-3sat]]、[[28-thm-cook-levin]]、[[28-thm-3sat-np-complete]]。"},{"id":"8db0d5d40e579d59","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"048daeb639b8a67f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0fc90210de59068","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"91493cff84d506fb","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SAT}$ 是本目录固定显式公式编码的可满足性语言，见 [[28-df-sat]]；$\\mathrm{TISP}$ 见 [[28-df-tisp]]。"}],"outgoing":["b830febc662345bf","c8f19b1793fdfb6a","2eb3efc252f058f9"]}